Tentang PT. Hattori IndonesiaPT Hattori Indonesia adalah bagian dari Takeshi Hattori Co., Ltd., yang berada di Negara Jepang. Sebagai produsen tekstil dengan standar kualitas tinggi Jepang, PT Hattori Indonesia terus berusaha mempertahankan reputasi dan keunggulan dalam industri tekstil. Karena perusahaan kami terus berkembang, kami sedang mencari individu yang memiliki dedikasi dan keahlian tinggi untuk bergabung dengan tim kami di Solokan Jeruk, Kabupaten Bandung, Jawa Barat. Keberhasilan PT Hattori Indonesia akan semakin terlihat dengan adanya talenta-talenta baru yang siap mengemban tanggung jawab besar. Jika Anda tertarik untuk bergabung dengan tim yang dinamis ini, dan ingin berkontribusi dalam pengembangan produk kelas internasional, maka PT Hattori Indonesia adalah tempat yang tepat bagi Anda.
Lamar posisi ini sekarang dan bergabunglah dengan tim kami!

CLOUD ADMINISTRATOR - MICROSOFT
We are seeking an experiencedCloud Administratorto manage, secure, and optimize our Microsoft Azure and Microsoft 365 environments. This role plays a key part in ensuring cloud reliability, cybersecurity resilience, and operational excellence across the organization.
KEY RESPONSIBILITIES
• Develop technical and operational standards, write procedures and technical documentation;
• Administer and support LCI's cloud IT infrastructures;
• Manage Azure environments, including defining operating rules and optimizing costs;
• Participate in the definition of standards, guidelines, best practices and measures related to the cloud;
• Act as a cybersecurity referent for the operations team and resolve cloud security incidents;
• Administer and monitor virtual servers and services hosted in Azure;
• Perform verification routines, security updates, and system recovery and recovery tests;
• Analyze business needs and assess risks to propose recommendations;
• Contribute to the maintenance and improvement of the security of the Microsoft 365 environment;
• Monitor the cybersecurity perimeter and play a leadership role in incident resolution;
• Participate in international technology projects with the global IT team;
• Stay up to date on emerging trends and technologies to anticipate the needs of the organization;
• Be available for interventions outside of regular working hours, as required.
REQUIREMENT
• Bachelor Degree in Technology (IT)
• Minimum experience 6 years with 3 years of Cloud Administrator experience
• Fluent in English both speaking and written
• Experience in education sectors in a plus
• Fluent in French and Spanyol in a plus
WHY JOIN WITH US?
  - 🌍 Work in an international and collaborative environment
🌍 Work in an international and collaborative environment
  - 🚀 Be part of strategic global technology projects
🚀 Be part of strategic global technology projects
  - 🔐 Play a key role in strengthening cybersecurity and cloud innovation
🔐 Play a key role in strengthening cybersecurity and cloud innovation
  - 📈 Opportunity to grow your expertise in a forward-thinking organization
📈 Opportunity to grow your expertise in a forward-thinking organization
  - 💡 Contribute to digital transformation initiatives that make real impact
