About the role
Become a IT Support with PT Optima Daya Energi, a leading provider of renewable energy solutions in South Jakarta, Jakarta. In this full-time role, you will be responsible for driving sales of our solar power systems to commercial and residential customers. You will leverage your strong technical expertise to recommend tailored solutions that meet our clients' energy needs.
Job Requirements
  - Minimum Bachelor Degree (S1) in Informatics Engineering/Information Systems / Computer Science or related field;
Minimum Bachelor Degree (S1) in Informatics Engineering/Information Systems / Computer Science or related field;
  - Minimum 1 year of experience; Fresh Graduates with Internship background are welcome to apply;
Minimum 1 year of experience; Fresh Graduates with Internship background are welcome to apply;
  - Experience in developing digital payment system (QRIS) and able to develop and build applications from scratch until ready for use;
Experience in developing digital payment system (QRIS) and able to develop and build applications from scratch until ready for use;
  - Understand electronic payment transaction flow and settlement systems.
Understand electronic payment transaction flow and settlement systems.
What we offerAt PT Optima Daya Energi, we are committed to providing our employees with a rewarding and fulfilling career. You'll enjoy a competitive salary, comprehensive benefits package, and opportunities for professional development. We foster a collaborative, supportive work environment that encourages innovation and personal growth.
About usPT Optima Daya Energi is a leading provider of renewable energy solutions in Indonesia. Our mission is to accelerate the transition to a sustainable energy future by offering cutting-edge solar power systems to commercial and residential customers. With a strong track record of successful projects, we are dedicated to helping our clients achieve their energy and sustainability goals.
Apply now to join our dynamic team as a IT Support.

